                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0f42804-df01-32ca-ab2c-5e8b00fb3703",
                        "entry_id": "ff160476-5807-32af-8e6f-5130379c5f05",
                        "glosses": [
                            "астрон. теория, принимающая Солнце за центр, вокруг которого происходит движение планет"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c14f9d60-8425-4571-88b2-49ffb191b93c",
                                "sense_id": "c0f42804-df01-32ca-ab2c-5e8b00fb3703",
                                "text": "Маше рассказали про Джордано, гелиоцентризм и что ведьмы были красивыми женщинами с дурным характером."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f33b447a-944a-4680-acde-faaef741ea8e",
                        "source_entry_id": "ff160476-5807-32af-8e6f-5130379c5f05",
                        "source_sense_id": "c0f42804-df01-32ca-ab2c-5e8b00fb3703",
                        "target_lang_word": "heliocentricism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heliocentricism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8bb6484-3334-38cf-8561-6422072695d9",
                                        "entry_id": "ccd15855-e4e8-331e-9b99-6263b063cf91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of heliocentrism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08459d0e-5ce2-4c26-a436-14f47541bda1",
                                                "sense_id": "a8bb6484-3334-38cf-8561-6422072695d9",
                                                "text": "And as to Copernicus, he declared most expressly in his preface that he spoke of Heliocentricism as a pure hypothesis; the imagination of which was useful for the calculation of planetary orbits, but which “need not be true or even probable,” i.e., resting on any solid ground whatever."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2d73358-7c60-4b5a-a263-05cd9fabefe1",
                                                "sense_id": "a8bb6484-3334-38cf-8561-6422072695d9",
                                                "text": "I do not say for example that Heliocentricism is no truer than Geocentricism, but is only a simpler hypothesis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
